  "notes": "Fusion RSS reader. Opening an article sets ?article=119 and slides a 864px panel from the right; the rest of the app is gaussian-blurred and greyed rather than just dimmed. Toolbar uses small outlined ghost buttons with line icons (Mark as unread, Star, Original external link) and a × close. Source shown as a tinted chip with a colored letter-favicon; feed favicons throughout are colored initial squares. Footer has Previous (disabled) / Next for keyboard-like stepping through the list. Neutral stone-grey palette with a single blue link accent; ~5px radii; very light shadows. Search in sidebar advertises Cmd+K and '/' shortcuts (command palette not verified)."
